  unitName: Soul Vortex Lemia
  unitId: 60165
  unitNumber: 476
  description: A sorceress specializing in necromancy. Her hopes of reviving her
    dead lover were dashed by Dilias. He had consumed the soul of the man she so
    longed to see. After learning the truth she went mad, cursing the entire world.
    She dedicated all her magic to seeing that all spirits were returned to a world
    of nothingness, as she wished to see what would be left after gods, men, the
    living, and the dead were all destroyed.
  summonDesc: Why do you appear before me?<br>I've nothing but despair now.<br>Do
    you still desire to battle?
  fusionDesc: I will soon break at this rate.<br>I can't forgive anything anymore.<br>Not
    even myself...
  evoDesc: There is no peace here.<br>That is why I must destroy all.<br>All can
    rest in peace then.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
